  "ciHistory": {
    "schema_version": "wringer.release-ci-history.v1",
    "note": "3ded3d1db7e8b6e7cd485729c4e0a512624e7f56 is the alpha.47 candidate. Its tests run passed all ten jobs and its permission run passed, each on the first attempt. Two earlier heads failed: ceaf98a, because alpha.47 added two schemas without regenerating integrations/assertion-adapter.txt (every build stopped at its consistency check; fixed in 1dfd9d6), and on Linux because GitHub's Ubuntu runners could not resolve any ubuntu.com host while installing the browser's fonts; 319c8f7 pointed apt's source files at the runner's Azure mirror, which failed the same way, and 3ded3d1 points apt's mirror list and source files at kernel.org, MIT and Princeton.",
